        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Exterior Plate for Omnia's D24441 Victorian Rope Knob Entrysets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe rope detailing on both the backplate and the knob of Omnia's Exterior Plate for Victorian Rope Door Knob Entryset, Omnia 24441SD00.1 gives it a traditional feel that borders on the side of extravagant. It looks expensive and will add tasteful elegance to any front door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D24441 Exterior Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Height 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-Drilled Doors, 2-1/8\" Bore Holes</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Door Knobs and Trim</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dummy: A non-functioning plate for the exterior side of the door. It has a fixed knob. Used as a door pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Active: knob turns and retracts a latch. This plate does not come packaged with a cylinder.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
